---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../../../components/Footer.astro';
import StudioModal from '../../../../components/StudioModal.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Longevity — Adaptive Studio"
  description="Longevity is not just about living longer. It is about staying capable, healthy and focused for as long as possible. How we approach it at Adaptive Studio."
  lang="en"
>
  <StudioModal lang="en" />
  <Nav lang="en" />

  <main>

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">
      <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-10">LONGEVITY</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading font-bold leading-[0.9] tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-10 reveal"
          style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 8rem)">
        Longevity isn't about<br>living longer.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed max-w-xl reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Not just live longer. Function well for longer.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- What it actually is — light -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24 border-t border-zinc-100">
      <div class="mb-16 reveal">
        <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-6">WHAT IT ACTUALLY IS</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
          The science is clear.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid md:grid-cols-3 md:divide-x divide-zinc-200 gap-16 md:gap-0">

        <div class="flex flex-col md:pr-12 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-100 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
             style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">01</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Quality of life, not just years</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">It's not about the number of years</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Longevity does not simply mean living longer. It means staying physically and mentally capable for as long as possible. The point is not just more years, but more years lived in good condition.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:px-12 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-100 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
             style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">02</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Genes aren't destiny</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">80% depends on you</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Research shows that genetics account for only 20–25% of how long and how well we live. The rest is lifestyle — movement, stress, sleep, inflammation. Things that can be consciously influenced.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:pl-12 reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <p class="font-heading font-bold text-zinc-100 leading-none mb-8 select-none"
             style="font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem)">03</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Nervous system as foundation</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">Chronic stress ages you</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Long-term stress puts strain on the whole body, weakens recovery and speeds up ageing. The ability to bring the body back into calm is not a trend. It is a real foundation of long-term health.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why most centres fall short — dark -->
    <section class="min-h-screen bg-[#111110] flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">
      <div class="mb-16 reveal">
        <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-6">THE PROBLEM WITH THE MARKET</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">
          Why most centres fall short.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 md:gap-0 md:divide-x divide-zinc-800">

        <div class="flex flex-col md:pr-12 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-6">Passive approach</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">You lie down. You leave. You learned nothing.</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Many centres offer treatments that feel good and bring short-term relief. Massages, IV drips, cryotherapy or red light can help. But if a person never learns how to work with their own body and stress, they often end up back in the same state soon after.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col md:pl-12 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-6">Optimisation without foundation</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Supplements don't help when the foundation is missing.</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            The market for quick solutions is growing too: supplements, peptides and smart devices. Some of these tools may have value. But without basics like sleep, movement, stress management and recovery, they cannot do the real work for you.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How we do it — light -->
    <section class="min-h-screen flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">
      <div class="mb-16 reveal">
        <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-6">OUR APPROACH</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
          Four pillars. One approach.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-4">We focus on the areas that have the strongest impact on how long and how well a person functions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-16 md:gap-0 md:divide-x divide-zinc-200">

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:pr-8 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Movement</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">Strength and fitness come first</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Good fitness is one of the strongest indicators of long-term health. That is why we do not train only for output, but also for movement quality, stability and the ability to handle effort without unnecessary tension.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:px-8 reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Nervous system</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">Regulation as a skill</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Long-term stress drains the body. Through breath, movement and simple practices, we teach the body to move between effort and recovery more effectively, including outside the studio.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:px-8 reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Inflammation</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">Direct recovery tools</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We use cryotherapy and red light as supportive tools for faster recovery, deeper calm and better handling of strain. They are not extras for effect, but part of a considered process.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col lg:pl-8 reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold text-sage mb-4">Mind</p>
          <p class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-3">Awareness as a tool</p>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Meditation, stretching and breathwork are not only about relaxing. They are skills that help quiet the mind, improve awareness of the body and build long-term resilience to stress.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What you take away — dark -->
    <section class="bg-[#111110] flex flex-col px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-20 py-24">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 items-center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-6">WHAT SETS US APART</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-8">
            You leave with a skill.<br>Not just a feeling.
          </h2>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
            This is where our approach differs. It is not just about a pleasant visit or short-term relief. We teach you methods you can use at home, at work and in the moments when life feels too much.
          </p>
          <p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Breathwork, conscious movement and the ability to calm the body have a direct effect on how you feel today and how you function in the long run.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 space-y-6">
          {[
            'You handle stress better instead of simply enduring it',
            'You move with more confidence and less unnecessary tension',
            'You recover faster — after training and after a hard day',
            'You understand your body better and know how to respond to it',
          ].map((item) => (
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 border-b border-zinc-800 pb-6">
              <span class="text-sage text-lg mt-0.5">→</span>
              <p class="text-white font-medium text-sm">{item}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="min-h-[60vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center py-24">
      <div class="reveal">
        <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase text-sage mb-8">FIRST STEP</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-zinc-900 mb-8"
            style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5rem)">
          Start living longer — and better.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3 max-w-sm mx-auto">
          The first step is a 30-minute conversation. We look at where you are now, what you need and what kind of path would make sense for you.
        </p>
        <p class="text-zinc-400 text-xs mb-12">No commitment.</p>
        <a
          href="https://calendly.com/jiri-adaptivestudio/30min"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-12 py-5 bg-zinc-900 text-white text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase hover:bg-zinc-700 transition-colors duration-200"
        >
          Book a consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer lang="en" />
</Layout>

<script>
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
    (entries) => {
      entries.forEach((entry) => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) entry.target.classList.add('visible');
      });
    },
    { threshold: 0.05, rootMargin: '0px 0px -5% 0px' }
  );

  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach((el) => {
    const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();
    if (rect.top < window.innerHeight) {
      el.classList.add('visible');
    } else {
      observer.observe(el);
    }
  });
</script>
